_privacy.py --selftest` checks the rule with six identity controls: both accepted pairs pass, mixed or foreign pairs fail. `validate.py` runs it.\n- [IMPORT.md](docs/IMPORT.md) and [VERIFICATION.md](docs/VERIFICATION.md) describe the rule.\n\nValidation: all 24 `validate.py` gates pass with GoogleTest 1.14.0 and Clang 18. The bare-metal job is unaffected (scripts and docs only).\n\nBlocks tsn-c-stack #14: its branch fails the privacy gate only because of this.\n","created_at":"2026-10-09T12:45:03Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T12:45:50Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"88c52e081704c95f72af060de4583167d30526df","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/tsn-c-stack/pulls/17/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/tsn-c-stack/pulls/17/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/tsn-c-stack/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/tsn-c-stack/issues/17/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/tsn-c-stack/statuses/61fb7c9a523b89cb96d493c5baf9f7f866ebed85","head":{"label":"kebag-logic:privacy-web-flow-squash","ref":"privacy-web-flow-squash","sha":"61fb7c9a523b89cb96d493c5baf9f7f866ebed85","user":{"login":"kebag-logic","id":142733852,"node_id":"O_kgDOCIHyHA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142733852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic","html_url":"https://github.com/kebag-logic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic/subscriptions","organi